@startuml create-google-sign-in-challenge
title Issue a Google sign-in challenge
hide footbox

participant "CRM client" as Client
participant CreateGoogleSignInChallengeController as Controller
participant "ISender / MediatR" as Mediator
participant CreateGoogleSignInChallengeHandler as Handler
database "SQL Server" as Database

Client -> Controller: POST /api/auth/google/challenge
Controller -> Mediator: Send(CreateGoogleSignInChallengeCommand)
Mediator -> Handler: Handle(command)
Handler -> Handler: Get UTC time from TimeProvider\nGenerate 32 random bytes and encode as hex\nSet expiry to now + 5 minutes
Handler -> Database: ExecuteDeleteAsync on expired\nGoogleAuthenticationChallenges rows
Handler -> Database: SaveChangesAsync with nonce and expiry
Database --> Handler: Challenge saved
Handler --> Mediator: CreateGoogleSignInChallengeResponse
Mediator --> Controller: nonce, expiresAtUtc
Controller --> Client: 200 OK with nonce and expiresAtUtc\nCache-Control: no-store
@enduml
